# PBIP/TMDL/PBIR content is diffed and reviewed as text; Power BI Desktop
# resaves these with CRLF on Windows, which turns every touched file into a
# full-file diff with no real content change. Force LF in the repo regardless
# of the client's core.autocrlf so diffs stay meaningful on any OS.
*.pbip text eol=lf
*.pbir text eol=lf
*.pbism text eol=lf
*.platform text eol=lf
*.tmdl text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.pq text eol=lf
*.dax text eol=lf
*.m text eol=lf
